# Line-ending policy (accepted; do not rewrite historical pilot artifacts solely
# to silence checkout warnings).
#
# - text=auto: Git normalizes text files to LF in the object store.
# - Working-tree line endings follow the local platform (core.autocrlf / checkout).
# - Research comparisons use *canonical* hashes (universal-newline → LF), not
#   on-disk byte identity of prompt.txt / extracted_candidate.py.
# - Companion / forensic ledgers under docs/experiments/analysis/ record both
#   file-byte and canonical hashes so CRLF vs LF ambiguity is explicit.
#
* text=auto

